OL,5,G1400 Nations Championship
OL,6,     FScotland v Australia (Kick-off
OL,7,     F3.10pm). Jill Douglas presents
OL,8,     Fcoverage of the Northern
OL,9,     FHemisphere Series match at
OL,10,     FScottish Gas Murrayfield. Scotland
OL,11,     Fhave an excellent recent record
OL,12,     Fagainst the Wallabies, winning
OL,13,     Ffour of the last five meetings
OL,14,     Fbetween the sides. The most recent
OL,15,     Fencounter saw them prevail 27-13
OL,16,     Fhere two years ago, with four
OL,17,     Fdifferent players scoring tries
OL,18,     Ffor the victors. With commentary
OL,19,     Fby Miles Harrison and Johnnie
OL,20,     FBeattie, analysis from John
OL,21,     FBarclay, Greig Laidlaw, and George
OL,22,     FGregan, and reports by Lee
