OL,5,G1800 I'm a Celebrity - How to Survive
OL,6,G     the Jungle
OL,7,     FAnt and Dec present hints and
OL,8,     Ftongue-in-cheek tips for
OL,9,     Fcelebrities to help survive not
OL,10,     Fonly the jungle and camp life, but
OL,11,     Falso campmates and their
OL,12,     Fassortment of annoying habits.
OL,13,     FThey also revisit some of the most
OL,14,     Fmemorable moments in the
OL,15,     Fprogramme's history, drawing on a
OL,16,     Fquarter of a century of terrifying
OL,17,     Ftrials and camp chaos to arm the
OL,18,     Fnext bunch of unsuspecting
OL,19,     Fcelebrities with an arsenal of
OL,20,     Fmust-have jungle hacks
