OL,5,G1900 UEFA Nations League Live
OL,6,     FSpain v England (Kick-off 7.45pm).
OL,7,     FMark Pougatch presents all the
OL,8,     Faction from both teams' final
OL,9,     Fmatch in Group A3, held at Riyadh
OL,10,     FAir Metropolitano Stadium in
OL,11,     FMadrid. The teams last met in the
OL,12,     Fopening round of fixtures in
OL,13,     FSeptember, when world champions
OL,14,     FSpain fought back from 2-1 down to
OL,15,     Fclaim a 3-2 win at Wembley
OL,16,     FStadium. It was the first meeting
OL,17,     Fbetween the nations since the UEFA
OL,18,     FEuro 2024 final in Berlin, which
OL,19,     Fthe Spaniards won 2-1, but the
OL,20,     FThree Lions will be hopeful of
OL,21,     Favoiding a third defeat in a row
OL,22,     Fto Luis de la Fuente's men, having
